tools.description:
Suggest changes to a document. changes is a list, each one of:
{"find": "exact text", "replace": "new text"} (inside one paragraph, heading or table cell);
{"insert_after": "exact text of the block before", "markdown": "new blocks"} ("" inserts at the end);
{"delete": "exact text in the block, list item or table row to remove"}.
Quote text exactly as docs_read shows it (without Markdown marks), enough to be found once. The user sees each
change with your reason and sources and accepts or rejects it, unless edits are set to Auto.
